Today is Sunday morning.
Yesterday afternoon was very hot.
So I did not go back to the shop yesterday.
Today's weather is cooler than Saturday's.
I am taking the small shirt to the shop.
First, I look for the receipt.
I look in my bag.
The receipt is inside the bag.
I take it out.
Then I put the receipt and the small shirt in the bag.
Now I go to the bus stop.
On Sunday, there are fewer vehicles on the road.
Today's bus journey is more comfortable than Saturday's.
After some time, I reach the town.
I get down from the bus.
I go straight to that garment shop.
The shop is open.
The shop is quite close by.
I set out with the bag.
